   "texto": [
    "In the verbs in **-ar**, the **-a** passes to **-e**: **falar** → **fale** (speak), **fales** (speak), **fale** (speak). In the verbs in **-er** and **-ir**, the vowel passes to **-a**: **comer** → **coma** (coma), **partir** → **parta** (parta).",
